<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Prompt-Driven Agentic Video Editing System: Autonomous Comprehension of Long-Form, Story-Driven Media</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Human-centered computing Interactive systems and tools</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Visual content-based indexing and retrieval</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Video summarization</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Intelligent agents</span></span></span>
